---
/**
 * Tijdlijn (Webflow-component "timeline-events"): kop met titel + rich text,
 * daarna genummerde stappen (foto of Vimeo-video | tekstblok met rookvideo) en een CTA.
 * Stappen wisselen af: oneven stappen (1, 3, …) foto links, even stappen foto rechts;
 * `reverse` draait dat om (eerste stap foto rechts). Op ≤991 altijd foto boven. Nummer is optioneel
 * (Webflow .section-two-columns gebruikt dezelfde opbouw zonder nummers).
 */
import type { ImageMetadata } from 'astro';
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
import Heading, { type HeadingGradient } from '../ui/Heading.astro';
import RichText from '../ui/RichText.astro';
import Button, { type Accent } from '../ui/Button.astro';
import BackgroundVideo from '../ui/BackgroundVideo.astro';
import CmsPicture from '../ui/CmsPicture.astro';
import VimeoEmbed from '../ui/VimeoEmbed.astro';
import type { RemoteImage } from '../../lib/sanity/image';
import type { Rich } from '../../lib/rich';

export interface TimelineStep {
  /** Leeg = geen nummer */
  number?: string;
  title: string;
  text: Rich;
  /** Foto, of anders een Vimeo-video (16:9, met bediening) */
  image?: { src: ImageMetadata | RemoteImage; alt: string };
  video?: { id: string; hash?: string; title: string; description?: string };
  cta?: { label: string; href: string };
}

export interface TimelineProps {
  title: string;
  intro: Rich;
  steps: TimelineStep[];
  cta?: { label: string; href: string; accent?: Accent };
  gradient?: HeadingGradient;
  reverse?: boolean;
}

type Props = TimelineProps;

const { title, intro, steps, cta, gradient = 'yellow', reverse = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section class:list={['timeline', { 'timeline--reverse': reverse }]}>
  <Container>
    <div class="timeline__heading" data-animate-stagger>
      <div class="timeline__col">
        <Heading as="h2" text={title} gradient={gradient} />
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__col">
        <RichText content={intro} size="lead" class="timeline__intro" />
      </div>
    </div>

    {
      steps.map((step, index) => (
        <div class:list={['timeline__step', { 'timeline__step--flip': (index % 2 === 1) !== reverse }]} data-animate-stagger>
          <div class="timeline__media">
            {step.image ? (
              <CmsPicture
                src={step.image.src}
                alt={step.image.alt}
                widths={[360, 480, 640, 720, 960, 1296, 1656]}
                sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 696px, 50vw"
                aspectRatio={16 / 9}
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="timeline__image"
              />
            ) : (
              step.video && <VimeoEmbed id={step.video.id} hash={step.video.hash} title={step.video.title} ratio="landscape" background={false} />
            )}
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__body">
            <div class="timeline__block">
              <BackgroundVideo />
              {step.number && (
                <span class="timeline__number" aria-hidden="true">
                  {step.number}
                </span>
              )}
              <Heading as="h3" text={step.title} gradient={gradient} />
              <div class="timeline__content">
                <RichText content={step.text} plain={!step.text.some((block) => 'ul' in block || 'ol' in block)} />
                {step.cta && <Button label={step.cta.label} href={step.cta.href} variant="ghost" />}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }

    {
      cta && (
        <div class="timeline__cta" data-animate>
          <Button label={cta.label} href={cta.href} accent={cta.accent} />
        </div>
      )
    }
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    z-index: var(--z-base);
    margin-block: var(--section-space);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .timeline__heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-inline: var(--row-margin);
  }

  .timeline__col {
    width: 50%;
    padding-inline: var(--column-gap);
  }

  .timeline__heading :global(.timeline__intro strong) {
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
  }

  .timeline__step {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: var(--timeline-step-gap);
  }

  .timeline__step--flip {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }

  .timeline__media,
  .timeline__body {
    width: 50%;
  }

  .timeline__media :global(.timeline__image) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .timeline__block {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    height: 100%;
    padding: var(--space-64);
    background-color: var(--color-black-a48);
  }

  .timeline__number {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--space-24);
    right: var(--space-24);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-number);
    line-height: 1em;
    opacity: 0.24;
  }

  .timeline__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-24);
  }

  .timeline__cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: var(--timeline-step-gap);
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .timeline__heading,
    .timeline__step,
    .timeline__step--flip {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .timeline__col,
    .timeline__media,
    .timeline__body {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .timeline__step,
    .timeline__cta {
      margin-top: var(--space-48);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .timeline__block {
      padding: var(--space-48);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 479px) {
    .timeline__block {
      padding: var(--space-32) var(--space-24) var(--space-24);
    }

    .timeline__number {
      top: var(--space-12);
      right: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
</style>
